  /                                                                 <a href=\"tel: 9289510063 (for Drone Training)\"> 9289510063 (for Drone Training)</a> \n739:                            <li><a href=\"https://in.linkedin.com/company/government-aviation-training-institute\" target=\"_blank\"><i class=\"fab fa-linkedin\"></i></a></li>\n763:                <a href=\"/contact-us#contact-us\">Register Now</a>\n777:    <!-- About Section Statrs -->\n782:                    <div class=\"about-img position-relative\">\n783:                        <img src=\"https://www.flywithgati.com/files/catalog/HomePageSec/GATI.jpg\" class=\"img-fluid\" alt=\"About Image\">\n787:                    <div class=\"about-desc\">\n789:                            <h3>Government Aviation Training Institute</h3>\n793:                            <p>Founded by the honorable Captain Bijayananda (Biju) Patnaik on 14th September 1946, the Orissa Flying Club at Bhubaneshwar, was one of the early and premier flying institutions of India. It was his dream, that the young men and women of Orissa be at the forefront, to train and become professional pilots of independent India. Since 1946, Orissa Flying Club has been a breeding ground for professional and recreational pilots. Initially a pursuit of the privileged, the club was more of a social and hobby center with the alumni engaged in flying in different parts of the world. Orissa Flying Club had a name and a presence nationally.</p>\n796:                            <a href=\"/our-story\"><span>About Us</span> <img src=\"/assets/frontend/images/news-arrow.svg\" alt=\"Right Arrow\"></a>\n805:    <!-- About Section Ends -->\n818:    <!-- Training Section Starts -->\n819:    <section class=\"home-training-block\" id=\"training-course\">\n824:                        <h3>Our Training Courses</h3>\n830:                        <p>At GATI, we make Professional Aviators. We are a Flying Training Organization licensed by the Directorate General of Civil Aviation (DGCA) to impart Ground training and Flight Instruction for issue of SPL, PPL, CPL, IR, Multi Engine Rating and ATPL flying licenses. GATI is also approved for complete Drone Pilot License training. Our Centers are spread across New Delhi, Bhubaneshwar and Birasal (Odisha) where we have a dedicated air field and base for day and night flight training and multirotor as well as fixed wing drone training. If you want to explore the world of Aviation, you are at the right place.</p>\n840:                            <a class=\"nav-link active\" data-toggle=\"tab\" href=\"#pilot-training\">Pilot Training</a>\n843:                            <a class=\"nav-link \" data-toggle=\"tab\" href=\"#drone-training\">Drone Training</a>\n851:                                                <div id=\"pilot-training\" class=\"container p-0 tab-pane active\">\n853:                                <div class=\"owl-carousel home-training-slide dots-after\">\n855:                                                                        <a href=\"/training-courses/training-philosophy\" class=\"training-box\">\n856:                                        <div class=\"training-in\">\n857:                                            <img src=\"/assets/frontend/images/training-philosophy-mob.png\" class=\"img-fluid\" alt=\"Training Philosophy\">\n858:                                            <div class=\"training-type\">\n860:                                                <h5 class=\"training-name\"><span>Training Philosophy</span> <img src=\"/assets/frontend/images/white-small-arrow-right.png\" alt=\"white-small-arrow-right\"></h5>\n866:                                                                                                            <a href=\"/training-courses/first-officer-programme\" class=\"training-box\">\n867:                                        <div class=\"training-in\">\n869:                                            <div class=\"training-type\">\n871:                   