training-name\"><span>Foreign Licence Conversion</span> <img src=\"/assets/frontend/images/white-small-arrow-right.png\" alt=\"white-small-arrow-right\"></h5>\n902:                                                                        <a href=\"/training-courses/simulator-training\" class=\"training-box\">\n903:                                        <div class=\"training-in\">\n904:                                            <img src=\"https://www.flywithgati.com/files/catalog/Training/Simulator_.jpg\" class=\"img-fluid\" alt=\"Simulator Training\">\n905:                                            <div class=\"training-type\">\n907:                                                <h5 class=\"training-name\"><span>Simulator Training</span> <img src=\"/assets/frontend/images/white-small-arrow-right.png\" alt=\"white-small-arrow-right\"></h5>\n911:                                                                        <a href=\"/training-courses/ground-school-for-cpl\" class=\"training-box\">\n912:                                        <div class=\"training-in\">\n913:                                            <img src=\"https://www.flywithgati.com/files/catalog/Training/SimCentre 4_.jpg\" class=\"img-fluid\" alt=\"Ground School For CPL\">\n914:                                            <div class=\"training-type\">\n916:                                                <h5 class=\"training-name\"><span>Ground School For CPL</span> <img src=\"/assets/frontend/images/white-small-arrow-right.png\" alt=\"white-small-arrow-right\"></h5>\n924:                                                <div id=\"drone-training\" class=\"container p-0 tab-pane \">\n926:                                <div class=\"owl-carousel home-training-slide dots-after\">\n930:                                                                                                            <a href=\"/training-courses/drone-school\" class=\"training-box\">\n931:                                        <div 